## 🗄️ Database Schema — `smartcity_db`

### 5 Tables

```sql
users         (id, name, email, password, phone, address, role[ADMIN|CITIZEN], created_at)
complaints    (complaint_id, user_id→users, category, description, location, status, date)
appointments  (appointment_id, user_id→users, doctor_name, specialization, date, time, status, notes, created_at)
bills         (bill_id, user_id→users, type, amount, due_date, status[Unpaid|Paid], issued_at)
announcements (id, title, content, category, posted_by→users, created_at)
```

